{"bookId": "38933073", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1689234611, "updated": [{"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_27_7100-7169", "createTime": 1689234611, "range": "7100-7169", "markText": "“这就是他所说的：‘一个不成熟的人的标志是他愿意为了某个理由而轰轰烈烈地死去，而一个成熟的人的标志是他愿意为了某个理由而谦恭地活下去。’”", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 27}, {"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_25_6746-6973", "createTime": 1689220818, "range": "6746-6973", "markText": "“我还以为是‘有人抓到别人’呢。”我说，“不管怎么样，我老是想象一大群小孩儿在一大块麦田里玩一种游戏，有几千个，旁边没人——我是说没有岁数大一点儿的——我是说只有我。我会站在一道破悬崖边上。我要做的，就是抓住每个跑向悬崖的孩子——我是说要是他们跑起来不看方向，我就得从哪儿过来抓住他们。我整天就干那种事，就当个麦田里的守望者得了。我知道这个想法很离谱，但这是我唯一真正想当的，我知道这个想法很离谱。”", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 25}, {"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_21_4566-4922", "createTime": 1689137002, "range": "4566-4922", "markText": "我对D.B.也不了解。他对战争恨之入骨，去年夏天却让我读一本《永别了，武器》。他说这本书特棒，这让我无法理解。书里有个叫亨利的少尉，按说是个不错的人。我不明白D.B.怎么一方面那么憎恨战争，一方面又喜欢那样一个装模作样的家伙。我是说，比如他一方面喜欢林·拉德纳的书，或是另外一本他喜欢得不得了的书——《了不起的盖茨比》——另一方面又会喜欢像《永别了，武器》这样一本虚伪的书。我这样说了后，D.B.不高兴，说我太小了，不懂欣赏，可是我不这么看。我告诉他我喜欢林·拉德纳和《了不起的盖茨比》，而且的确如此。我万分喜欢《了不起的盖茨比》，这个盖茨比，真是个堂堂正正的人物，这本书让我喜欢得要命。不管怎么样，我对发明了原子弹这件事有点儿开心。再来场战争的话，我他妈会端坐到原子弹的弹头上。我自愿报名，向上帝发誓，我会的。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21}, {"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_20_3985-4078", "createTime": 1689052339, "range": "3985-4078", "markText": "他是那种装模作样的家伙，为了回答别人的问题，得给自己腾点地方才行。他后退一步，刚好踩到身后一位女士的脚上，很可能把她的脚趾全踩碎了。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 20}, {"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_18_6015-6044", "createTime": 1688982576, "range": "6015-6044", "markText": "天主教徒总是想知道你是不是天主教徒，这种事我遇到过很多次。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18}, {"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_16_7335-7472", "createTime": 1688958254, "range": "7335-7472", "markText": "“你看，”我说，“我今天晚上感觉不太好，说实话，我今天晚上很难受。我会给你钱的，你不介意我们不干那个吧？你很介意吗？”问题是，我真的不想干了。说实话，我心里的沮丧感超过了性冲动。她让我沮丧，她那身绿裙子也是。再说，我想我永远也不会跟一个整天看破电影的人干那个，真的觉得不能。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16}, {"bookId": "38933073", "bookmarkId": "38933073_16_3826-4045", "createTime": 1688957932, "range": "3826-4045", "markText": "问题是多数情况下，我几乎跟一个女孩儿干上时——我是说不是妓女什么的——她老是叫你停下来，我的毛病是我真的停下来，多数人才不会呢，可是我没法不停。我永远搞不明白她们是真想让你停呢，还是她们只是吓得要死，要么是她们尽管嘴上一直叫你停，目的却是等你真的干完后就归罪于你，而不是她们。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "22", "chapterUid": 25, "chapterIdx": 25}, {"title": "18", "chapterUid": 21, "chapterIdx": 21}, {"title": "17", "chapterUid": 20, "chapterIdx": 20}, {"title": "15", "chapterUid": 18, "chapterIdx": 18}, {"title": "13", "chapterUid": 16, "chapterIdx": 16}, {"title": "24", "chapterUid": 27, "chapterIdx": 27}], "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "version": 1064463594, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KCO+kXthMOiyVvQ?y+kBVv", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#370e16"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#400214"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#480013"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#4d2525"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#571d20"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#62101a"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#693b36"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#74342e"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#7f2b25"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#940012"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#8f4e44"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#a63d30"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#82544d"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#c45946"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#9c6e67"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#b76151"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#b68980"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#c48376"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#d27c6b"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#ec6c53"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#f09683"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#fd8f77"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#ff876a"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#ecbdb3"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#fdb7a7"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#ff9f7e"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#f2dfda"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#ffb89a"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#d27c6b"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#f09683"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#F3E8E5"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#F3E8E5"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#270500"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#d5321f", "hsv": [6.243762984337801, 85.65718958964737, 83.70121951219512]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#ec6c53", "#ff876a"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7JHkSPmtI", "review": {"bookVersion": 1309504638, "bookId": "38933073", "content": "", "type": 4, "star": 100, "reviewId": "17408780_7JHkSPmtI", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689314939, "isFinish": 1, "isDeepV": 1, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 1, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JHgiBiQ9", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "塞林格如此讨厌剧本，就像现在我讨厌短视频和网文一样。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "8548-8646", "abstract": "还有D.B.，要是他想在一个舒适安静的地方写作，我会让他去我那里过一阵子，不过他不能在我的小屋里写电影剧本，只能写短篇小说和书。我要定下一条规矩，就是不管谁来看我，都不许做虚伪的事，谁要做就别待。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 28, "reviewId": "17408780_7JHgiBiQ9", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689310739, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 28, "chapterTitle": "25", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 8}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JEvHdnEu", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "家里的味道，每个人都有吧。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "1219-1294", "abstract": "我们家的门厅里，有种跟其他任何地方都不一样的气味。我也不知道到底是他妈什么味，不是花椰菜，也不是香水，我也不知道是他妈什么味，可我总会知道自己到了家。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 24, "reviewId": "17408780_7JEvHdnEu", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689154444, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 24, "chapterTitle": "21", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JEuei6wX", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "第三次提到公园里的鸭子，这些鸭子到底去哪过冬？", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "4027-4070", "abstract": "我琢磨可以经过那个小湖，看看那些鸭子在他妈干吗，还在不在，我不知道它们是不是还在那儿。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 23, "reviewId": "17408780_7JEuei6wX", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689153101, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 23, "chapterTitle": "20", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 2, "likesCount": 8}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JEd2lmI1", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "塞林格讨厌虚假，包括电影，话剧，演员，还有海明威。虽然我并不理解塞林格说海鸣威的虚假到底指什么。不过塞林格与米兰昆德拉倒是有点像，米兰昆德拉的《不能承受的生命之轻》就是在反媚俗。", "chapterUid": 21, "type": 1, "bookVersion": 1309504638, "reviewId": "17408780_7JEd2lmI1", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689137350, "contextAbstract": "18\n离开滑冰场后，", "userEditTime": 1689137526, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 21, "chapterTitle": "18", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JEcHwIpY", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "塞林格不喜欢海鸣威，认为他很虚伪。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "4566-4922", "abstract": "我对D.B.也不了解。他对战争恨之入骨，去年夏天却让我读一本《永别了，武器》。他说这本书特棒，这让我无法理解。书里有个叫亨利的少尉，按说是个不错的人。我不明白D.B.怎么一方面那么憎恨战争，一方面又喜欢那样一个装模作样的家伙。我是说，比如他一方面喜欢林·拉德纳的书，或是另外一本他喜欢得不得了的书——《了不起的盖茨比》——另一方面又会喜欢像《永别了，武器》这样一本虚伪的书。我这样说了后，D.B.不高兴，说我太小了，不懂欣赏，可是我不这么看。我告诉他我喜欢林·拉德纳和《了不起的盖茨比》，而且的确如此。我万分喜欢《了不起的盖茨比》，这个盖茨比，真是个堂堂正正的人物，这本书让我喜欢得要命。不管怎么样，我对发明了原子弹这件事有点儿开心。再来场战争的话，我他妈会端坐到原子弹的弹头上。我自愿报名，向上帝发誓，我会的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21, "reviewId": "17408780_7JEcHwIpY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689137042, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 21, "chapterTitle": "18", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JEbQioWM", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "逗死我了。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "2317-2386", "abstract": "前一年跟萨莉这妞儿一块儿看过，她老是说那些戏装什么的太漂亮了等等。我说如果耶稣他老人家看到这些——还有稀奇古怪的戏装什么的——他没准会吐的", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21, "reviewId": "17408780_7JEbQioWM", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689136256, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 21, "chapterTitle": "18", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JBPA7NGi", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "又是五块钱，用五块钱作为判断价值的标准，或者十块。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "2123-2189", "abstract": "他们要价五块，因为这张唱片很难买到，我无所谓。乖乖，这张唱片让我一下子心花怒放，真想一步跨到公园，去看菲比这丫头在不在，好给她唱片。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 19, "reviewId": "17408780_7JBPA7NGi", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1689002261, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 19, "chapterTitle": "16", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 0}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JBuQ6a7H", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "本章形成了前后强烈的张力，霍尔顿为了5元挨了揍，却要给修女捐赠10元甚至更多；可以招妓，但是却为了与修女讨论《罗密欧与朱丽叶》而不好意思；把烟喷到修女脸上而感到十分抱歉，完全是为了修女考虑，善良的霍尔顿。", "chapterUid": 18, "type": 1, "bookVersion": 1309504638, "reviewId": "17408780_7JBuQ6a7H", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688983259, "contextAbstract": "15\n我没睡太久，因", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "15", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 12, "friendLikesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JBmfUcnM", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "太真实了，就像每次在机场看到那么多人拖着仿造Rimowa的旅行箱一样。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "2819-2918", "abstract": "这没什么，我也知道，但是我讨厌看到别人用这种便宜货。这听起来很不像话，但是如果别人拎着这种便宜的手提箱，仅仅看到箱子，我甚至就会讨厌起这个人来。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "reviewId": "17408780_7JBmfUcnM", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688975395, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "15", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 1, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JBlw5QfL", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "对于一个17岁男孩，长得好就够了。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "1735-1760", "abstract": "然后我就挂掉了电话。她真叫我头疼，不过长得倒挺好。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "reviewId": "17408780_7JBlw5QfL", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688974718, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "15", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JBeP3Fve", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "这两者关系很大，我也通常会认为身边的人比其他人聪明，实际上我经常认为其他人都是傻逼，除了身边的人。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "886-950", "abstract": "我有个大毛病，就是不管是谁，只要跟我一起黏糊过，我都会觉得她是个脑瓜很聪明的人。这两者之间是他妈毫无联系，可我仍然老是这样认为。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "reviewId": "17408780_7JBeP3Fve", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "createTime": 1688968585, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "15", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JB2XTklr", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "霍尔顿同时联想到自己，虽然那次自己觉得没有喝多，但是别人会闻到他的酒气，所以也就不想喝了。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "2141-2238", "abstract": "没到旅馆前，我正要走进一家样子邋遢的酒吧，两个喝得烂醉的家伙刚好出来，跟我打听怎么搭地铁。其中一个长得很像古巴人，给他们指路时，他一直往我脸上喷酒气。结果，我根本没进那家破酒吧，只是回到了旅馆。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "reviewId": "17408780_7JB2XTklr", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688957722, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 16, "chapterTitle": "13", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JAs9ajYt", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "霍尔顿就是这么有个性，可以拉出租车司机去喝酒，却不愿意跟他哥的前女友喝两杯。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "6099-6147", "abstract": "“我正要走呢，”我告诉她，“我得跟别人见个面。”看得出，她只是想笼络我，好让我向D.B.提起她。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "reviewId": "17408780_7JAs9ajYt", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688923992, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 15, "chapterTitle": "12", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 11}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7JA9vUGGZ", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "越来越喜欢美国文学这种时而混不吝，时而一本正经的劲儿。对，就是他妈的王小波那个路数，还有海明威，钱德勒，凯鲁亚克他们。", "chapterUid": 13, "type": 1, "bookVersion": 1309504638, "reviewId": "17408780_7JA9vUGGZ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688906921, "contextAbstract": "10\n当时还挺早，说", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "10", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Jya8Fpjd", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "那个学校都会有这样的一个老师，或者是什么主任，要不就是校长。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "6874-6943", "abstract": "例如每逢星期天，他四处去和每一个开车来看孩子的家长握手，一副真他妈魅力无穷的样子，但对几位有点儿上了年纪、模样又滑稽的学生家长则不是这样。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7Jya8Fpjd", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688793893, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "02", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Jy9R8fiO", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "拒绝长大，又不想被当作孩子，只是为了尊严吗？", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "5713-5747", "abstract": "“不，先生！我当然不会。”我说。我他妈真希望他别老是叫我“孩子”了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5, "reviewId": "17408780_7Jy9R8fiO", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688793634, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "02", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Jrgj4ZEn", "review": {"bookId": "38933073", "content": "这个描写挺绝的，即刻画了女孩，又反衬了第一人称的性格。", "bookVersion": 1309504638, "range": "1773-1968", "abstract": "尔玛·瑟默这妞儿——她是校长的闺女——倒是经常去球场上露露脸，但是说起来她算不上那种能让你想入非非的女孩儿，不过她还算挺不错。有次在从埃吉斯镇开出的大巴上，我跟她坐一起，我们多少聊了几句。我喜欢她。她鼻子长得不小，手指甲全是啃短的，好像还在流血。她戴着那种垫高了的破胸罩，绷得鼓鼓的，你会有点儿同情她。我喜欢她，因为她没多说她爹如何如何了不起之类的屁话，大概她也知道她爹是个卑鄙虚伪的货色。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "reviewId": "17408780_7Jrgj4ZEn", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1688401942, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "38933073", "format": "epub", "version": 1064463594, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/73/38933073/s_38933073.jpg", "title": "麦田里的守望者（出版70周年纪念版）", "author": "J.D.塞林格", "translator": "孙仲旭", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "01", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 18}}